# M12 — Data: status

Updated: 2026-11-21 · App: Mieruka · Team: Zero-Ichi

- `models.py`: Region, Building, Household, Profile, Adapter, Installation (adapter on an appliance for a period), Event (anomaly, efficiency, standby_cut, forced_on, pause), Reading (real data), Alert, SavingAction, TokenTx, ChallengeEntry, SolidarityProject, Contribution, LearningProgress, SimState.
- The database stores facts only; energy is computed by `m1.model`. Small and serverless-friendly (Turso on Vercel).
- `data.py`: installation/spec loading, day matrices, IEA CO₂ factor.
